sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Customer
    participant P as Customer panel
    participant R as Core: Request module
    participant CS as CollateralService
    participant Y as Yaghut
    participant DB as Oracle
    P->>R: GET /api/customer/requests/{id}/deposits
    R->>Y: POST /deposit {cif, OPEN, ACTUAL, owner and signatory, rial} with the customer JSESSIONID
    Y-->>R: deposits with group, depositType, availableBalance
    Note over R: filter again: individual, open, not blocked, rial. Classify cheap or expensive. Balances never stored.
    R-->>P: eligible deposits
    U->>P: cash share, pledge share, selected deposits
    P->>R: POST .../collateral
    R->>CS: calculate(amount, shares, deposits)
    Note over CS: cash = c x A, pledge on cheap first x 1.00, then expensive x 1.05 capped at 95 percent of balance, round up
    alt shares invalid or balance insufficient
        CS-->>R: violation
        R-->>P: 400 insufficient balance message (SRS)
    end
    CS-->>R: allocations per deposit
    R-->>P: summary with green ticks
    P->>R: POST .../submit
    R->>DB: SELECT FOR UPDATE NOWAIT, save collateral rows
    R->>DB: status PENDING_BRANCH_REVIEW, audit
    R-->>P: 200 submitted
